{"id":"chatcmpl-dbb698a4-ed1b-4759-9e68-5a222371d146","object":"chat.completion","created":1795230981,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a verification-heavy workflow for medical image interpretation where laterality ambiguity is the key risk. The successful strategy combined expert model consultation, targeted region-of-interest zooming, and explicit re-verification of spatial conventions before committing to an answer. The pattern generalizes to any visual classification task where orientation markers or projection conventions can flip the answer.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a visual finding's laterality or orientation is ambiguous, explicitly verify the spatial convention (markers, projection rules) before finalizing rather than trusting initial visual impression.\",\n    \"Use targeted region-of-interest cropping/zooming to directly inspect the anatomical region most relevant to the discriminating finding, rather than relying on whole-image gestalt.\",\n    \"Consult a domain expert model with a focused question that directly addresses the ambiguity, then cross-check its reasoning against visual evidence.\",\n    \"When two answer options differ only by a spatial attribute (side, location), treat that attribute as the primary verification target and audit it separately from finding detection.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"medical_imaging_interpretation\": \"Always confirm orientation markers and projection conventions before assigning laterality; zoom into the specific anatomical region that discriminates between options.\",\n    \"visual_multiple_choice_with_spatial_options\": \"Identify the single attribute that distinguishes the options (side, quadrant, level) and verify that attribute independently with a focused check.\",\n    \"expert_model_assisted_decision_making\": \"Ask the expert model a narrowly scoped question targeting the ambiguity, then reconcile its answer with direct visual inspection before committing.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the orientation/laterality marker and projection convention before assigning a side to any finding.\",\n    \"Re-inspect the discriminating region at higher zoom and cross-check against the expert model's reasoning before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":683,"total_tokens":1072,"completion_tokens":389,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":683},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":389}}}